**No pressure. No preaching. Just good food, honest conversation, and space to explore.**

Alpha is a relaxed, welcoming place to talk about the big questions of life and faith. You don’t need to know anything about Christianity, and you don’t have to agree with anyone. Come curious, ask questions, and see where the conversation takes you.

**Everyone is welcome—invite a friend who’s curious about faith or simply looking for a place to have a meaningful conversation.**

**Details:**\
Sundays • 1–3 PM\
Beginning September 6\
Lunch provided\
Childcare available if needed\
1820 Eden Terrace
